2. HR Interview had situation based questions. Try aligning your answer to company''s core values', '[0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.30447,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.20172,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.30447,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.22932,0.00000,0.31939,0.00000,0.00000,0.30169,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.22858,0.00000,0.15455,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.22284,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.19379,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.39437,0.00000,0.29122,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.14659,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.15222,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.28276,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000]');
INSERT INTO interview_experiences_pgvector (experience_id, company_name, role, batch, branch, author, date, title, technical_topics, key_questions, preparation_tips, full_text, embedding) VALUES ('6f2076ad7778a392766bdfecf1f98900d3f771e0c712945c2136ea358cae6736', 'Medtronic', '', '2022-2026', '', 'VIKAS PUNDIR', '21 Sept 2026', 'Medtronic - 12 Month Mtech Intern', '{"System Design"}', '{}', '', 'Round 1: Resume Based Shortlisting
146 students filled the form
100 got shortlisted for OA.

Round 2: Online Assessment
100 students gave OA, out of which only 25 were selected for the technical interview.
Details: 3 Coding Questions (1 ML, 2 Dev) + Gen AI + ML + DL + Dev MCQs

Round 3: Technical Interview (3 Phases)
Phase 1: 7 Students Gave Tech Interview.
Phase 2: 18 Students Gave Tech Interview.
Phase 3: 9 Students Gave Tech Interview.
Details (Personal): 15 minutes of system design + 5 minutes Introduction (including why I switched from civil engineering to CSE) + 5 minutes hypothetical question (basically personality + mindset check)

Round 4: Interview with IT Director (Phase-wise)
Phase 1: 3 Students Gave Interviews.
Phase 2: 9 Students Gave Interviews.
Phase 3: 5 Students Gave Interviews.
Details (Personal): 5 minutes of introduction (in-depth)

Round 5: Final Selection
Phase 1: 1 Student Selected
Phase 2: 2 Students Selected
Phase 3: 2 Students Selected

Total Selection = 5/146.
Thanks for reading; feel free to reach out on LinkedIn.', '[0.00000,0.00000,0.07176,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.05386,0.00000,0.04906,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.06199,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.07338,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.06659,0.00000,0.00000,0.06267,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.07440,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.08011,0.00000,0.19184,0.00000,0.21249,0.14415,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.29352,0.12488,0.05352,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.06221,0.03565,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.04754,0.00000,0.21179,0.00000,0.00000,0.24976,0.13112,0.07618,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.78073,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.07405,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000]');
INSERT INTO interview_experiences_pgvector (experience_id, company_name, role, batch, branch, author, date, title, technical_topics, key_questions, preparation_tips, full_text, embedding) VALUES ('ce153c9c14c0ea168e36658503c0a8db5a6cde7f90cf61a89fd811631d3ecf21', 'NXP', '', '2022-2026', 'IT', 'VANSHIKA', '21 Sept 2026', 'NXP', '{"Operating Systems","Core Electronics"}', '{}', '', 'The selection process consisted of a single interview, as it was a short process conducted during my end-semester examinations of the 6th semester. The interview covered topics such as 8085 architecture, VLSI, and basic concepts from the subjects studied as part of the curriculum and projects ofc.

For students interested in core ECE opportunities, I would suggest having a strong understanding of the fundamental concepts of your core subjects and maintaining a good CGPA, as it can play an important role during the shortlisting process. Apart from technical preparation, the interview is also about presenting your knowledge, skills, and experiences confidently.

Focus on understanding concepts rather than just memorizing them, and be confident during the interview.

All the best!
PS: Keep your resume project on tips.', '[0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.20073,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.14283,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.36268,0.15696,0.25981,0.18093,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.15388,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.16569,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.15094,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.29788,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.15633,0.00000,0.15388,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.17408,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.28673,0.00000,0.12238,0.10216,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.11071,0.14596,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.15269,0.00000,0.12784,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.18184,0.34337,0.00000,0.00000,0.08623,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.18369,0.00000,0.26236,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000]');
