INSERT INTO interview_experiences_pgvector (experience_id, company_name, role, batch, branch, author, date, title, technical_topics, key_questions, preparation_tips, full_text, embedding) VALUES ('8d12b75c07bf7bb085b67a0128affe5b96541a6baf30d7411fc90b7cde58cac7', 'Infosys', '', '2022-2026', '', 'GUTHULA VENKATA SRAVAN', '18 Sept 2026', 'INFOSYS (HackWithInfy)', '{"DSA","DBMS","Operating Systems","System Design"}', '{}', '', 'rounds - 3 (two OAs and one interview)

In OA-1 , 3 questions were asked. each one on binary search , dp and heap.

In OA-2 , 4 questions were asked and ranked from easy to complex. mostly binary search, greedy and dp(2D grid dp in particular).

I solved 1st and 4th question and got selected for L3 role. try to solve hard(3rd) and complex(4th) questions to get selected for L2 and above roles.

In the interview, one LeetCode question (partitions dp) needed to be solved in 10-15 mins on leetcode platform in front of the interviewer. Even if you are not able to solve the question, try to explain your idea and way of doing it to the interviewer. Finally there was an virtual interview and questions about your project, cs fundamentals (mostly DBMS and OS) and how do you scale your project (any) to millions of users ( system design question). At last gave offer DSE role (6.25lpa + 1lakh bonus)', '[0.00000,0.17407,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.19863,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.16880,0.00000,0.17687,0.15945,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.13278,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.11777,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.16166,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.20843,0.25387,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.27135,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.22835,0.00000,0.54074,0.30989,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.27235,0.00000,0.13231,0.00000,0.27135,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000]');
