Be aware of the roles present(L3/L2/L1/DSE).', '[0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.30044,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.29770,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.23306,0.00000,0.45111,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.12972,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.25332,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.16649,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.28929,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.38571,0.25424,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.25332,0.26597,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.15021,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000]');
INSERT INTO interview_experiences_pgvector (experience_id, company_name, role, batch, branch, author, date, title, technical_topics, key_questions, preparation_tips, full_text, embedding) VALUES ('4838569c1d6cc4a2938a9e6b37f2193202463c5a14353db2a790898a0bc8bb82', 'Infosys', '', '2022-2026', '', 'AADITYA KUMAR', '17 Sept 2026', 'Infosys Interview Experience', '{"DSA","Operating Systems"}', '{"Interview Experience"}', '', 'Infosys Placement Experience

I am sharing my Infosys placement experience for anyone preparing for the placement process.

1. Online Hackathon

The first round was an online hackathon consisting of easy, medium, and hard-level DSA questions. I solved two questions completely, while 2–3 test cases failed for the last, hard-level question.

2. In-Person OA

The next round was an in-person coding assessment with three questions covering topics like Arrays, Dynamic Programming, Greedy Algorithms, and Graphs. I solved two questions completely, while around 50% of the test cases passed for the last question.

Based on my performance, I was selected for the DSE (Digital Specialist Engineer) role. Solving the questions correctly and within the given time may also help in qualifying for higher-level roles.

3. Interview Experience

The interview was mainly based on my resume. The interviewer asked questions about my projects, technical skills, and the things I had mentioned in my resume.

My suggestion is to prepare your resume properly and be ready to explain everything you have written in it, especially your projects and the technologies you have used.

Advice

I appeared for this placement mainly to get some experience with the interview and placement process, without having particularly high expectations for the role. However, I got selected.

So, just keep preparing, practice DSA, understand your resume, and give your best in every round. Don''t take unnecessary pressure. Stay calm, do your hard work, and see how things go.

All the best!', '[0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.06049,0.07128,0.00000,0.12986,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.08204,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.11406,0.14716,0.00000,0.24875,0.08087,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.09140,0.00000,0.09846,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.16926,0.07731,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.08883,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.33041,0.09374,0.00000,0.17154,0.00000,0.11476,0.08883,0.00000,0.08264,0.14168,0.00000,0.00000,0.39594,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.09294,0.00000,0.20876,0.00000,0.00000,0.10862,0.11205,0.00000,0.11610,0.16467,0.28311,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.25165,0.16588,0.16818,0.00000,0.00000,0.16527,0.00000,0.00000,0.07264,0.00000,0.07679,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.04900,0.10715,0.19784,0.00000,0.09102,0.10438,0.08955,0.00000,0.00000,0.09986,0.00000,0.00000,0.08234,0.00000,0.00000]');
INSERT INTO interview_experiences_pgvector (experience_id, company_name, role, batch, branch, author, date, title, technical_topics, key_questions, preparation_tips, full_text, embedding) VALUES ('ebe72f23a872bf705e0b68fc561aa142eafc6108cb4331d881d87d38f0f66d26', 'Infosys', '', '2022-2026', '', 'GURKARANBIR SINGH', '17 Sept 2026', 'Infosys', '{"DSA"}', '{}', 'Focus heavily on DP and Graphs. Practice under timed conditions. Know your resume and projects thoroughly. Think out loud during the interview.', 'Infosys Interview Experience

Online Assessment (2 coding rounds): Each round had 4 questions, all from DP and Graphs. Difficulty was medium to hard, and optimized solutions were needed to pass all test cases. I solved the ones I was confident about first, then attempted the harder ones.

Technical Interview: Started with a DSA question [Rabin karp algorithm]. I explained a brute force approach, then optimized it while discussing complexity. This was followed by a detailed resume discussion covering my projects, tech stack choices and challenges faced.

Result: Selected (DSE)

Tips:

Focus heavily on DP and Graphs.
Practice under timed conditions.
Know your resume and projects thoroughly.
Think out loud during the interview.', '[0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.20929,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.17394,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.20019,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.18552,0.00000,0.17955,0.00000,0.12140,0.00000,0.00000,0.21337,0.00000,0.23074,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.30977,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.23277,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.28002,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.17286,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.28331,0.20091,0.11514,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.30703,0.00000,0.13679,0.19664,0.00000,0.20164,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.22029,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.11957,0.00000,0.24138,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000,0.00000]');
